{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EO0JEXmn5X1794306332.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>「幻彩詠香江」下周三將作告別演出。</p><p></p><p>旅發局表示，有22年歷史的「幻彩詠香江」，最後一場表演將加入煙火元素。至於代替「幻彩詠香江」的其他光影項目，會在明年陸續推出。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHOW-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RSmQRRaY9y1794306360.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>「幻彩詠香江」自2004年起每晚8時，在港島和九龍43幢建築物及兩個景點，投放互動燈光及音樂效果。今年9月9日起已暫停。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.070958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:32.211344+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:00.965492+00:00","content_hash":"5ee04b8d8162e42262af1cae5084790ec5a2b864ae498f2e5037add5605fecde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}